      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "When the pier fell into disrepair in the 1930s, commercial fishing in Shelter Cove sharply declined.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.humboldthistory.org/history-nuggets/2023/4/20/shelter-cove",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Cape Mendocino Light was helicopter‑lifted to Mal Coombs Park in 1998, adding a historic beacon to Shelter Cove’s skyline.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
